# Shape: same-origin. ONE domain serves both apps, path-routed.
# Imported inside the main site block of infra/caddy/Caddyfile when
# MANTLE_CADDY_SHAPE=same-origin (the default). Release-owned; do not edit on
# a box (routes a box needs go in conf.d/).
#
# Server-owned paths: the API plane, the share + print render surfaces, the
# generated runtime bundles those surfaces load, and the MCP OAuth discovery
# docs. Everything else (owner UI, /login, /hub, /team*, /env.js, /_next/*,
# fonts) falls through to the client app; both publics ship identical
# font/runtime assets, so either could serve them and the client is the
# natural default. Env for this shape: MANTLE_SERVER_ORIGIN=https://<domain>
# (the client app needs an absolute origin for its server-side appearance
# fetch). MANTLE_CLIENT_SITE_ADDRESS and MANTLE_API_CORS_ORIGINS stay unset.
@server path /api /api/* /s /s/* /print /print/* /share-runtime/* /app-runtime/* /.well-known/oauth-authorization-server /.well-known/oauth-protected-resource
handle @server {
	reverse_proxy web:3000
}
handle {
	reverse_proxy client-web:3000
}
